	<http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/ICD9CM/ICF> """The following fifth-digit subclassification is for use with category 948 to indicate the percent of body surface with third degree burn; valid digits are in [brackets] under each code: {0 less than 10 percent or unspecified; 1 10-19%; 2 20-29%; 3 30-39%; 4 40-49%; 5 50-59%; 6 60-69%; 7 70-79%; 8 80-89%; 9 90% or more of body surface}"""^^xsd:string ;
	<http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/ICD9CM/ICN> """Note: This category is to be used when the site of the burn is unspecified, or with categories 940-947 when the site is specified."""^^xsd:string ;
	<http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/ICD9CM/SOS> """Excludes: sunburn (692.71, 692.76-692.77)"""^^xsd:string ;
	umls:cui """C0433219"""^^xsd:string ;
