	<http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/ICD9CM/SOS> """Includes: arthrodesis of spine with: {bone graft; internal fixation}"""^^xsd:string ;
	<http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/ICD9CM/ICC> """Code also any: insertion of interbody spinal fusion device (84.51); insertion of recombinant bone morphogenetic protein (84.52); the total number of vertebrae fused (81.62-81.64); synchronous excision of (locally) harvested bone for graft (77.70-77.79)"""^^xsd:string ;
