	<http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/ICD9CM/ICN> """Note: Number of vertebrae: The vertebral spine consists of 25 vertebrae in the following order and number: Cervical: C1 (atlas), C2 (axis), C3, C4, C5, C6, C7; Thoracic or Dorsal: T1, T2, T3, T4, T5, T6, T7, T8, T9, T10, T11, T12; Lumbar and Sacral: L1, L2, L3, L4, L5, S1; Coders should report only one code from the series 81.62 or 81.63 or 81.64 to show the total number of vertebrae fused on the patient."""^^xsd:string ;
	umls:cui """C1135456"""^^xsd:string ;
