	<http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/ICD9CM/ICC> """Code also any: angioplasty (00.61-00.62, 00.66, 39.50); atherectomy (17.53-17.56); endarterectomy (38.10-38.18); insertion of vascular stent(s) (00.55, 00.63-00.65, 36.06-36.07, 39.90); other removal of coronary artery obstruction (36.09)"""^^xsd:string ;
